# Cloudflare static asset headers (copied to dist on build).
#
# `cant` ships inside the Rite release archive, so this site serves no installer
# or artifact of its own and this file only sets the security headers the Rite
# site sets. If that ever changes, the /install rules from
# apps/rite-web/public/_headers belong here too, with the same
# `Content-Type: text/x-shellscript` care: Cloudflare's SPA fallback will
# otherwise answer a missing asset with 200 + index.html, and a shell script that
# is really HTML fails in a way nobody enjoys debugging.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
